---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Prima Veritas">

<main class="flex-1">

  <PageHero
    title="Privacy Policy"
    subtitle="What we collect, and what we keep."
  />

  <Section title="Online demo">
    <p>
      The online upload demo is currently unavailable. The sections below describe how it
      handled information while it was available.
    </p>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Information you provide">
    <p>
      When you downloaded an artifact, the following was recorded together with the artifact
      hash, event count, and a timestamp:
    </p>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-off-white/70 list-none">
      <li>→ Email address — required for artifact download</li>
      <li>→ Company name — optional</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Uploaded data">
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-off-white/70 list-none">
      <li>→ Files are processed for validation and artifact generation</li>
      <li>→ Uploaded files are deleted after processing</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Generated artifacts">
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-off-white/70 list-none">
      <li>→ Artifacts are created based on your submitted data</li>
      <li>→ Artifacts are stored on our server to enable download</li>
      <li>→ Artifacts are not automatically deleted; they are kept until removed</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Technical information">
    <p>
      We may collect limited system-level data to maintain reliability.
    </p>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-off-white/70 list-none">
      <li>→ IP address</li>
      <li>→ Request timestamps</li>
      <li>→ File size and row count</li>
      <li>→ Artifact hash</li>
      <li>→ Basic usage data</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section title="How we use information">
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-off-white/70 list-none">
      <li>→ Deliver artifact downloads</li>
      <li>→ Maintain system reliability</li>
      <li>→ Understand legitimate usage patterns</li>
      <li>→ Respond to inquiries</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section title="What we do not do">
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-off-white/70 list-none">
      <li>→ We do not sell your data</li>
      <li>→ We do not use advertising trackers</li>
      <li>→ We do not retain your uploaded files after processing</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Data retention">
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-off-white/70 list-none">
      <li>→ Uploaded files — deleted after processing</li>
      <li>→ Generated artifacts — kept until removed (no automatic deletion)</li>
      <li>→ Download records (email, company name, artifact hash, event count, timestamp) — kept until deleted; used for communication</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Security">
    <p>
      We implement reasonable safeguards to protect the information we handle.
    </p>
    <p>
      No system is completely secure.
    </p>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Contact" last={true}>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy?
    </p>
    <a href="mailto:contact@primaveritas.io"
      class="nav-link text-sm hover:text-[var(--accent)] transition-colors">
      → contact@primaveritas.io
    </a>
    <p class="text-off-white/40 text-xs mt-4">Last updated: September 30, 2026</p>
  </Section>

</main>

</Layout>